  "releaseNotes": "﻿### Fixed\n- Fixed backslash path separators in ProjectReference paths to satisfy the msbuild-path-separator check\n### Changed\n- Switched test projects from xunit.v3.mtp-v2 to the Native AOT-compatible xunit.v3.aot.mtp-v2 and bumped FunFair.Test.Common/FunFair.Test.Source.Generator to 6.4.0.2617\n- Dependencies - Updated CSharpIsNullAnalyzer to 0.2.19\n- Dependencies - Updated Credfeto.Extensions.Linq to 1.0.160.1934\n- Restricted NuGet PackageReference asset flow (IncludeAssets) on non-analyzer packages to reduce build-time supply-chain risk, per meziantou.net guidance on limiting what NuGet packages can do\n- Dependencies - Updated Nullable.Extended.Analyzer to 1.16.6891\n- Dependencies - Updated Credfeto.Enumeration to 1.2.154.2267\n- Dependencies - Updated FunFair.Test to 6.4.6.2749\n- Dependencies - Updated FunFair.Test.Source.Generator to 6.4.6.2749\n- Dependencies - Updated Credfeto.Version.Information.Generator to 1.0.138.1557\n- Dependencies - Updated Microsoft.Sbom.Targets to 4.1.13\n- SDK - Updated DotNet SDK to 10.0.402\n- Dependencies - Updated FunFair.CodeAnalysis to 7.2.20.2501\n- Dependencies - Updated Microsoft.VisualStudio.Threading.Analyzers to 18.12.1\n- Dependencies - Updated Roslynator.Analyzers to 5.0.1\n- Dependencies - Updated SonarAnalyzer.CSharp to 10.35.0.4138\n- Dependencies - Updated xunit.analyzers to 2.2.0\n- Dependencies - Updated xunit.v3 to 4.0.2\n- Dependencies - Updated Microsoft.Extensions to 10.0.13\n- Dependencies - Updated Meziantou.Analyzer to 3.0.316",
